WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.084 --> 00:00:03.253
You're First Lieutenant
Amanza Volchkova, right?

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:04.671
Yes, sir!

00:00:04.713 --> 00:00:07.882
I took a hostage from the mining ship
I was a prisoner on,

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:09.175
and escaped.

00:00:09.592 --> 00:00:11.761
I'll get the commander on the line.
Speak to him.

00:00:12.262 --> 00:00:13.596
First Lieutenant Amanza.

00:00:13.722 --> 00:00:15.306
Give me the details.

00:00:15.765 --> 00:00:17.934
Tell me the location
of the illegal mining ship.

00:00:17.976 --> 00:00:19.728
Yes, sir.

00:00:19.811 --> 00:00:22.605
I would like you to use the IFN channel.

00:00:22.731 --> 00:00:24.607
The die has been cast.

00:00:25.608 --> 00:00:27.110
Come on now, boss!

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:30.071
The magnetic field
surrounding the ship is on.

00:00:30.113 --> 00:00:32.615
Opening the bumpers to their maximum.

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:38.830
Clair. How long is left
until the maximal flare?

00:00:38.955 --> 00:00:41.207
Based on Maya's predictions,
we have 15 minutes!

00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:44.169
The 20 rounds is all that's left
from the Orichalt stock.

00:00:44.961 --> 00:00:46.296
Prepare yourselves, kids!

00:00:46.838 --> 00:00:48.381
Here we go!

00:00:52.969 --> 00:00:56.181
So, when you escaped,
the illegal mining ship

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:58.850
was in the Regulus system
of the Leo constellation?

00:00:58.975 --> 00:00:59.851
Yes, sir.

00:00:59.934 --> 00:01:02.020
I'll check in with the
joint squadron command.

00:01:02.103 --> 00:01:05.857
Until then, I'm putting you
under surveillance.

00:01:05.982 --> 00:01:07.233
Do as you wish!

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:13.990
-Rick!
-All right!

00:01:18.995 --> 00:01:21.790
-My fair lieutenant!
-Enough with familiarities!

00:01:23.875 --> 00:01:26.419
-Do you want to die here?
-Oh, I apologize!

00:01:28.046 --> 00:01:29.839
It's almost the time. Hurry up!

00:01:29.881 --> 00:01:31.174
Shut up! I know.

00:01:39.182 --> 00:01:41.810
Thirty-two seconds
until the Prominence launch.

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:46.022
Am I a criminal now, too?

00:01:51.694 --> 00:01:52.445
It's time!

00:01:55.698 --> 00:01:57.450
X line arcade confirmed!

00:01:57.700 --> 00:01:58.827
Launching Prominence!

00:01:58.868 --> 00:02:01.204
Orichalt's gravitational wave confirmed!

00:02:10.213 --> 00:02:11.881
Orichalt's teleportation
confirmed!

00:02:14.384 --> 00:02:17.095
Great, I'm in a Miguel jump, too.

00:02:17.178 --> 00:02:18.179
Get lost!

00:02:21.891 --> 00:02:25.270
Scouts 04, 05, pursue!
Battle regulations 03 permitted!

00:02:25.311 --> 00:02:27.730
Don't let them get away!
Take care of this!

00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:29.107
Gravitational waves detected!

00:02:29.232 --> 00:02:30.942
Wh-- What did you say?!

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:34.404
Explosion!

00:02:34.445 --> 00:02:36.739
Plasma particles detected!

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:37.907
Set the magnetic field!

00:02:37.949 --> 00:02:42.203
-Shifting into emergency defense state!
-Joint search system has shut down!

00:02:42.245 --> 00:02:45.748
Launching automated shielding.
Due to emergency, steering is impossible!

00:02:45.874 --> 00:02:48.042
How could the fleet's squadron be fooled

00:02:48.084 --> 00:02:50.753
by mere miners?!

00:02:50.753 --> 00:02:53.089
My part here is done!

00:02:53.423 --> 00:02:55.258
Now it's your turn, Ido!

